The Board of Directors of Logiciel Solutions Limited ('the Company'), at their Meeting held today i.e., Saturday, 14th November, 2026 has inter-alia approved the following:
1. Unaudited Financial Results along with the Limited Review Report thereon for the half-year ended 30th September, 2026;
2. Statement of NIL Deviation or Variation pursuant to Regulation 32 of the SEBI LODR Regulations for the half-year ended 30th September, 2026;
3. Other matters as per agenda of meeting.

You are requested to take the same on record.

Thanking you,

Logiciel Solutions Ltdhas informed BSE that the meeting of the Board of Directors of the Company is scheduled on 14/11/2026 ,inter alia, to consider and approve 1. Unaudited Financial Results along with the Limited Review Report thereon for the half-year ended 30th September, 2026;
2. Statement of Deviation or Variation pursuant to Regulation 32 of the SEBI LODR Regulations for the half-year ended 30th September, 2026;
3. Other matters as per agenda of the Notice.
